{"id":1456965,"date":"2026-02-03T10:36:27","date_gmt":"2026-02-03T09:36:27","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/?p=1456965"},"modified":"2026-04-03T16:31:54","modified_gmt":"2026-04-03T14:31:54","slug":"babel-minots-2026","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/actualite-famdt\/babel-minots-2026\/","title":{"rendered":"Les rencontres pros de Babel Minots 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Les r\u00e9servations pour les rencontres professionnelles du Festival Jeune Public Babel Minots sont ouvertes !<\/strong><br>Nous avons le plaisir de vous annoncer l\u2019ouverture des r\u00e9servations pour les rencontres professionnelles de Babel Minots, qui se tiendront du <strong>10 au 13 mars 2026 \u00e0 Marseille<\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Un rendez-vous incontournable organis\u00e9 avec l\u2019<a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/agesca.poleinfomusique?__cft__[0]=AZbPRirS1VeNVNPtIWSTSwtv3okA0OCwqkP4VqJQninatKOu4T6h52dtQCdevbxT-USwJeCitX1uQs0lnpjglJWzSvE4_Yn7LGtMkEBnT7TZyOXPD2NxtJfdQG-6SRRuuy2uyxayS_mT6kTRW02ssrks_sKFH2xW6ADtdm3QZ4fH50FKtOTO2It_2ZEiFirOW-0&amp;__tn__=-]K-R\">Agesca Pim<\/a> en partenariat avec <a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ReseauRamDam?__cft__[0]=AZbPRirS1VeNVNPtIWSTSwtv3okA0OCwqkP4VqJQninatKOu4T6h52dtQCdevbxT-USwJeCitX1uQs0lnpjglJWzSvE4_Yn7LGtMkEBnT7TZyOXPD2NxtJfdQG-6SRRuuy2uyxayS_mT6kTRW02ssrks_sKFH2xW6ADtdm3QZ4fH50FKtOTO2It_2ZEiFirOW-0&amp;__tn__=-]K-R\">Ramdam, le r\u00e9seau des musiques jeune public<\/a> , le r\u00e9seau des musiques jeune public et <a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/LMELB?__cft__[0]=AZbPRirS1VeNVNPtIWSTSwtv3okA0OCwqkP4VqJQninatKOu4T6h52dtQCdevbxT-USwJeCitX1uQs0lnpjglJWzSvE4_Yn7LGtMkEBnT7TZyOXPD2NxtJfdQG-6SRRuuy2uyxayS_mT6kTRW02ssrks_sKFH2xW6ADtdm3QZ4fH50FKtOTO2It_2ZEiFirOW-0&amp;__tn__=-]K-R\">LMELB<\/a>, la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/LaSacem?__cft__[0]=AZbPRirS1VeNVNPtIWSTSwtv3okA0OCwqkP4VqJQninatKOu4T6h52dtQCdevbxT-USwJeCitX1uQs0lnpjglJWzSvE4_Yn7LGtMkEBnT7TZyOXPD2NxtJfdQG-6SRRuuy2uyxayS_mT6kTRW02ssrks_sKFH2xW6ADtdm3QZ4fH50FKtOTO2It_2ZEiFirOW-0&amp;__tn__=-]K-R\">Sacem<\/a> et le R\u00e9seau Art et Tout Petit .<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Le programme se d\u00e9cline en trois parcours :<\/strong><br>\u2192 un parcours d\u00e9di\u00e9 aux professionnels de La Petite Enfance<br>\u2192 un parcours Programmation &amp; Diffusion autour du spectacle jeune public<br>\u2192 un parcours \u00c9ducation Artistique et Culturelle remettant le sens de nos actions au c\u0153ur de nos projets.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Pour qui ? <\/strong>\u00c0 destination des professionnel\u00b7les de la culture, de la petite enfance, du social, et ouvertes \u00e0 toute personne travaillant aupr\u00e8s de l\u2019enfance et de la jeunesse.<br><br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Comment r\u00e9server ? <\/strong>Les places sont limit\u00e9es ! R\u00e9servez d\u00e8s maintenant pour garantir votre pr\u00e9sence. N\u2019h\u00e9sitez pas \u00e0 r\u00e9server des spectacles en parall\u00e8le pour d\u00e9couvrir le festival \u00e0 hauteur d\u2019enfant. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/www.billetweb.fr\/rencontres-professionnelles-du-festival-babel-minots-12?fbclid=IwY2xjawPuopNleHRuA2FlbQIxMABicmlkETFjQW90RVVNb240MW5IcGJac3J0YwZhcHBfaWQQMjIyMDM5MTc4ODIwMDg5MgABHqNLgkgfVm1lrzPdknsSKkvvBNiYEDF9XKfkeeQkW_SmW-XzLoyg2pCdfbyq_aem_jOzv2YAj0-sk_G3wWraayQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Inscriptions ici<\/a><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/www.babelminots.com\/babelminots-rencontres-pros?fbclid=IwY2xjawPuoqdleHRuA2FlbQIxMABicmlkETFjQW90RVVNb240MW5IcGJac3J0YwZhcHBfaWQQMjIyMDM5MTc4ODIwMDg5MgABHlAKSdA2De1Ujy6CDlH7J5ZgKwsg4EgcMOaSOxs0G-3Om3ts_PbKNO0Xzx3R_aem_IT4ejAE9ULEHtzRo8dmf4A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Programme d\u00e9taill\u00e9<\/a><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/Unknown.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">T\u00c9L\u00c9CHARGER LE PROGRAMME EN PDF<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"819\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/618394427_1526488839476557_1297372987161438095_n-819x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1456986\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/618394427_1526488839476557_1297372987161438095_n-819x1024.jpg 819w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/618394427_1526488839476557_1297372987161438095_n-240x300.jpg 240w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/618394427_1526488839476557_1297372987161438095_n-768x960.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/618394427_1526488839476557_1297372987161438095_n.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 819px) 100vw, 819px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"819\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/618770309_1526488816143226_5000517426808960670_n-819x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1456989\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/618770309_1526488816143226_5000517426808960670_n-819x1024.jpg 819w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/618770309_1526488816143226_5000517426808960670_n-240x300.jpg 240w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/618770309_1526488816143226_5000517426808960670_n-768x960.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/618770309_1526488816143226_5000517426808960670_n.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 819px) 100vw, 819px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">L&rsquo;\u00e9dito des rencontres pros<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Faire soci\u00e9t\u00e9 : R\u00f4le de l\u2019art dans la construction d\u2019un futur en bonne sant\u00e9 culturelle<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Faire Soci\u00e9t\u00e9, c\u2019est l\u2019adn du festival Babel minots.&nbsp; \u00c0 travers sa programmation, sa politique tarifaire, sa r\u00e9partition territoriale, il r\u00e9unit les g\u00e9n\u00e9rations, est accessible \u00e0 tous et sur tout le territoire marseillais. Faire soci\u00e9t\u00e9 c\u2019est la th\u00e9matique que nous travaillerons cette ann\u00e9e lors de nos rencontres professionnelles sous diff\u00e9rentes formes&nbsp; (conf\u00e9rences, table-rondes, ateliers, film, d\u00e9bats) du mardi 10 mars&nbsp; au vendredi 13 mars 2026. Quels r\u00f4les les artistes, le spectacle jeune public, nos lieux de culture, nos actions culturelles peuvent-ils jouer dans la construction d\u2019une soci\u00e9t\u00e9 ? Une soci\u00e9t\u00e9 qui construit avec sa jeunesse un futur en paix et en bonne sant\u00e9 culturelle.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"683\" hei